    11        2049     415998681    142364319625            5             0
    12        4097    2438235715   1367428536133            2            13

  FORBIDDEN NUMBERS AND BERNOULLI POWER SUMS:
    S_1(3) = 1+2+3 = 6 = 7-1
    S_1(6) = 1+...+6 = 21
    S_2(3) = 1+4+9 = 14 = 2*7
    So 7 = S_1(3)+1, 21 = S_1(6) = 3*7 = T_6 (6th triangular number)
    21 = T_6, and T_n = n(n+1)/2 via Bernoulli: -B_2 * C(n+1,2) + ...

  RAPIDITY OF POWER SUMS S_m(p) for Paley primes p:
