4. COLLATZ TRAJECTORIES IN RAPIDITY SPACE
======================================================================

  Rapidity step sizes:
    n -> n/2:    delta_rapidity = -ln(2)/2 = -0.34657359
    n -> 3n+1:   delta_rapidity ~ +ln(3)/2 = 0.54930614 (+ correction O(1/n))
    Combined (3n+1)/2: delta ~ ln(3/2)/2 = 0.20273255

